":2000,"height":1125,"alt":"","rel":["full","day","interior"]}]},"attendance":22092},"article":{"headline":"Tayven Jackson, Jahiem White propel North Texas to 48-41 victory over Florida Atlantic","description":"— Tayven Jackson passed for 404 yards and four touchdowns, Jahiem White rushed for 193 yards and two scores and North Texas held off Florida Atlantic 48-41 on Thursday night.","story":"DENTON, Texas -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4801307/tayven-jackson\" target=\"_new\">Tayven Jackson</a> passed for 404 yards and four touchdowns, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4911971/jahiem-white\" target=\"_new\">Jahiem White</a> rushed for 193 yards and two scores and North Texas held off Florida Atlantic 48-41 on Thursday night.\n\n\r\n              Jackson completed 33 of 46 passes as North Texas (6-2, 4-0 American Conference) extended its win streak to five. White did his damage on 26 carries.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4869991/caden-veltkamp\" target=\"_new\">Caden Veltkamp</a> finished with a season-high 452 yards and five touchdowns — matching his career high — on 37-for-56 passing for Florida Atlantic (5-3, 2-2). <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4914830/easton-messer\" target=\"_new\">Easton Messer</a> totaled a school-record 16 receptions for 189 yards and three scores.\n\n\r\n              Veltkamp's 18-yard touchdown pass to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5215467/branden-hoch\" target=\"_new\">Branden Hoch</a> helped the Owls lead 10-3 after one quarter.\n\n\r\n              Jackson connected with <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5149220/baron-tipton\" target=\"_new\">Baron Tipton</a> for an 8-yard touchdown to tie it 10-all early in the second quarter, but Veltkamp and Messer teamed up for a 27-yard score and a 17-10 lead on the ensuing drive.\n\n\r\n              Jackson answered with a 3-yard scoring toss to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5194308/kyle-koch\" target=\"_new\">Kyle Koch</a> to tie it, and <a href=\"https://x.com/American--Conf/status/2115973704152662099?a=DLOv9jATTN9rfYgng9E&s=20\">White scored</a> on a 59-yard first-down run after a three-and-out by the Owls for a 24-17 advantage.\n\n\r\n              Veltkamp connected with Messer for a 12-yard score with 39 seconds left to tie it 24-all at halftime.\n\n\r\n              Jackson threw a 4-yard touchdown pass to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5122082/justin-stevenson\" target=\"_new\">Justin Stevenson</a> following an Owls' turnover to up the lead to 34-24.\n\n\r\n              Veltkamp answered with 22-yard touchdown pass to <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5146725/kaden-shields-dutton\" target=\"_new\">Kaden Shields-Dutton</a>, but White ran 20 yards to the 1 before scoring two plays later and North Texas took a 41-31 lead into the fourth quarter.\n\n\r\n              Veltkamp fired a 34-yard scoring strike to Messer to cut it to 41-38 with 8:26 remaining, but Jackson came back with a 2-yard scoring toss to Koch to push the lead back to 10.\n\n\r\n              It was the first FBS game this season with two 400-yard passers as the teams combined for 1,167 yards of offense.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Florida Atlantic: Hosts UTSA on Nov. 5.\n\n\r\n              North Texas: Hosts Rice on Nov. 7.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Fnewsletters&data=05%7C02%7C%7Cdcd4c927a3014947713f08def3da887f%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaaaaaaaaaaa%7C1%7C0%7C639216317087773713%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=592GG7Tx9gHi6vEFt3ytKh9NsJsnsJX5%2FPfFbPmAML8%3D&reserved=0\">Sign up for Top 25 poll alerts here</a>. Visit <a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Fhub%2Fap-top-25-college-football-poll&data=05%7C02%7C%7Cdcd4c927a3014947713f08def3da887f%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaaaaaaaaaaa%7C1%7C0%7C639216317087791086%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=ia6nZ9tg%2FZcgm%2BFi8LWTUGjusXBzP7sDOqfdsmjeNig%3D&reserved=0\">the Top 25 here</a> and see AP’s full <a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fapnews.com%2Fhub%2Fcollege-football&data=05%7C02%7C%7Cdcd4c927a3014947713f08def3da887f%7C84df9e7fe9f640afb435aaaaaaaaaaaa%7C1%7C0%7C639216317087810304%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=qcVbI2ec6BmMJKNCLT%2FCF5%2FSYMV2T%2F%2F4IEoIlao%2FR%2Bk%3D&reserved=0\">college football coverage here.</a>","published":"2026-10-30T04:02:45Z"}}